    audioEffect: 0
  - cn: "\u2026\u2026\u961F\u957F\u53BB\u4E16\u4E86\uFF1F\uFF01"
    en: ' ...The captain passed away?!'
    cnHaveBranch: 0
    cnBranch: []
    enHaveBranch: 0
    enBranch: []
    isPlayerTalking: 0
    isAside: 0
    codes: 
    onlyCode: 0
    speaker: 5
    expression: 5
    showCg: 0
    cgNum: 0
    minigameType: 0
    uncomfortType: 0
    audioEffect: 0
  - cn: "\u8FD9\u4E0D\u662F\u5728\u5F00\u73A9\u7B11\u5427\u2026\u2026\u961F\u957F\u600E\u4E48\u4F1A\u6B7B\u5462\u3002"
    en: This is not a joke, right... How could the captain die?
    cnHaveBranch: 0
    cnBranch: []
    enHaveBranch: 0
    enBranch: []
    isPlayerTalking: 0
    isAside: 0
    codes: 
    onlyCode: 0
    speaker: 5
    expression: 3
    showCg: 0
    cgNum: 0
    minigameType: 0
    uncomfortType: 0
    audioEffect: 0
  - cn: "\u62B1\u6B49\uFF0C\u4F46\u8FD9\u662F\u771F\u7684\u3002"
    en: I am sorry. I'm afraid so.
    cnHaveBranch: 0
    cnBranch: []
    enHaveBranch: 0
    enBranch: []
    isPlayerTalking: 1
    isAside: 0
    codes: 
    onlyCode: 0
    speaker: 5
    expression: 3
    showCg: 0
    cgNum: 0
    minigameType: 0
    uncomfortType: 0
    audioEffect: 0
  - cn: "\u90A3\u6211\u4EEC\u73B0\u5728\u600E\u4E48\u529E\uFF0C\u8FDE\u961F\u957F\u90FD\u6B7B\u4E86\uFF0C\u6211\u4EEC\u6240\u6709\u4EBA\u90FD\u4F1A\u6B7B\u5728\u8FD9\u91CC\u7684\uFF01\u6211\u4E0D\u60F3\u6B7B\u2026\u6211\u60F3\u56DE\u5BB6\u3002"
    en: Then what do we do now? Even the captain is dead. All of us are going to
      die here! I do not want to die... I want to go home.
    cnHaveBranch: 0
    cnBranch: []
    enHaveBranch: 0
    enBranch: []
    isPlayerTalking: 0
    isAside: 0
    codes: 
    onlyCode: 0
    speaker: 5
    expression: 3
    showCg: 0
    cgNum: 0
    minigameType: 0
    uncomfortType: 0
    audioEffect: 0
  - cn: "\u51B7\u9759\u4E9B\uFF0C\u6D1B\u5C14\u574E\uFF0C\u6211\u4EEC\u4F1A\u6D3B\u4E0B\u6765\u7684\u3002"
    en: Calm down, Lorquin. We will survive.
    cnHaveBranch: 0
    cnBranch: []
    enHaveBranch: 0
    enBranch: []
    isPlayerTalking: 1
    isAside: 0
    codes: 
    onlyCode: 0
    speaker: 5
